SUMMARY:Interchange Message: PIMLICO STATION: From Friday 9 October until 
 late December\, no down escalator. Please use the stairs. To avoid the 
 stairs\, or if you are travelling with luggage\, buggies or small 
 children\, please use local bus services 2\, 36\, or 185 from Vauxhall 
 Bridge Road\, stop A for Victoria and stop D for Vauxhall. Route 360 also 
 serves Vauxhall from stop H on Bessborough Street.
